      <p>Finding an apartment in Spain as a foreigner is doable but requires patience. The rental market works differently than the UK, US, or most English-speaking countries. This guide covers finding properties, understanding deposits and contracts, what documents you need, navigating tenant law, and avoiding the scams that trap unsuspecting expats.</p>
